{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102390","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910239001:1":{"text":"할머니, 이... 이게 어떻게 된 거야?","source_cn":"阿嬷，这……这是怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA6FEE94A74B8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910239002:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910239003:1":{"text":"얘들아, 큰일 났구나... <style=\"highlight\">타라사가... 예정보다 일찍 잠수하기 시작했단다.</style>","source_cn":"孩子们，出事了……<style=highlight>塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C1FF7AF1B57AFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910239004:1":{"text":"뭐, 뭐라고? 왜 벌써? 며칠 뒤라고 했잖아.","source_cn":"什、什么？怎么这个时候就下潜了？不是说几天后才——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFEE472931F43DE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910239005:0":{"text":"바, 바다가 흔들려! 가라앉겠어!","source_cn":"海，海在摇！我们要去海底了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F08502824591F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910239006:0":{"text":"아니야! 할머니가 말씀하셨잖아. 우리는 조금 더 깊은 바다로 내려갈 뿐이지, 가라앉는 게 아니라고!","source_cn":"才不是！阿嬷说过的，我们只会去稍微深一点的海，不会一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF81119FE1BBA0CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910239007:0":{"text":"흑흑, 어, 어떡하지...","source_cn":"呜呜……怎、怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2718A80F2C2221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910239008:1":{"text":"언니... 나... 힘들어... 불편해...","source_cn":"姐姐……难受，不舒服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A71C4328EFF5BF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910239009:1":{"text":"샤이? 왜 그래? 어디가 불편해?","source_cn":"小汐儿？！你怎么了，哪里不舒服？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF27786AF36D06E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910239010:1":{"text":"엄마! 할머니! 샤, 샤이 좀 봐주세요! 숨을 못 쉬어요!","source_cn":"妈妈！阿嬷！快，快看看小汐儿！她喘不上气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8B774596D1DA73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910239011:1":{"text":"아가, 괜찮아... 걱정하지 말렴, 얘야. 수압 때문이란다.","source_cn":"嘘，嘘……不要担心，我的孩子。是水压。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27EA82295425B025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910239012:1":{"text":"타라사가 너무 빠르게 내려가서 아직 우리 샤이가 갑작스러운 수압 변화에 적응하지 못하는 게지.","source_cn":"塔拉萨下降的速度太快，小汐儿年纪太小，还不习惯水压的骤变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9277A944141C6B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910239013:1":{"text":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","source_cn":"阿嬷向你保证，小汐儿会没事的，只是需要休息。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD75FBDE576A3B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","female":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","variant_male_record_index":"254779","variant_female_record_index":"254780","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1910239013":{"text":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","source_cn":"阿嬷向你保证，小汐儿会没事的，只是需要休息。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD75FBDE576A3B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","female":"이 할미가 약속하마. 샤이는 조금만 쉬면 괜찮아질 거란다.","variant_male_record_index":"254779","variant_female_record_index":"254780","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910239014:1":{"text":"是的，年轻的孩子。我们已经共渡了四次洄游季，但波涛长者的下潜从来没有这样突然，下降速度还这样快。","source_cn":"是的，年轻的孩子。我们已经共渡了四次洄游季，但波涛长者...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x511741B7AA0571A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254781","variant_female_record_index":"254782","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910239015:1":{"text":"남다른 재능을 타고난 너라면, 해류 속에서 거세게 요동치는 그 광란의 기운을 느낄 수 있겠지...","source_cn":"孩子，你拥有超乎常人的天赋，你应该能感受到洋流中奔涌着...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBB191D1206BB05A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"남다른 재능을 타고난 너라면, 해류 속에서 거세게 요동치는 그 광란의 기운을 느낄 수 있겠지...","female":"남다른 재능을 타고난 너라면, 해류 속에서 거세게 요동치는 그 광란의 기운을 느낄 수 있겠지...","variant_male_record_index":"254783","variant_female_record_index":"254784","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910239016:0":{"text":"你当然能。从塔拉萨突然下沉开始，你就察觉到了周围海水的异样。","source_cn":"你当然能。从塔拉萨突然下沉开始，你就察觉到了周围海水的异样。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB1836827B77EB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910239017:1":{"text":"无数魔法能量在水中汹涌奔流，几近沸腾。它们激起无形的水花，在你身周的每一处狂乱跳荡。","source_cn":"无数魔法能量在水中汹涌奔流，几近沸腾。它们激起无形的水...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAE4A3C0D70A42A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1910239017":{"text":"无数魔法能量在水中汹涌奔流，几近沸腾。它们激起无形的水花，在你身周的每一处狂乱跳荡。","source_cn":"无数魔法能量在水中汹涌奔流，几近沸腾。它们激起无形的水花，在你身周的每一处狂乱跳荡。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAE4A3C0D70A42A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910239018:1":{"text":"탄생의 연못 때문이겠구나.","source_cn":"恐怕是繁育池。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75E20A82944DEEAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910239019:1":{"text":"우리가 모은 양분은 이미 어미 산호의 에너지가 되어 회유기를 준비하고 있었단다. 하지만 갑작스럽게 잠수하면서... 어쩌면 탄생의 연못이 손상되어 에너지가 밖으로 새어 나오고 있는지도 모르겠구나.","source_cn":"我们收集的养料已经化作母瑚的能量，为洄游季做准备。但突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9784FE4321600E73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910239020:1":{"text":"어, 어떻게 이런 일이... 그럼 회유기는요? 회유기는 어떡해요?","source_cn":"怎、怎么会这样……那洄游季，洄游季怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD52031B74528DC7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910239021:1":{"text":"沫霖姐姐不要伤心，那些能量逃跑了，我们去把它抓回来就不行了？","source_cn":"沫霖姐姐不要伤心，那些能量逃跑了，我们去把它抓回来就不行了？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6D17FB5BAAC3D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910239022:1":{"text":"지금 바로 갈게요!","source_cn":"我这就去！","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0xA26553BFB4568FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910239023:1":{"text":"...엘피라! 밖은 위험할지도 몰라! 혼자 나가면 안 돼... 어서 돌아와!","source_cn":"——艾菲拉！外面可能很危险，不要一个人出去……快回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E353B5D4EDB7B41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910239024:1":{"text":"소리만 지르면 뭐 하냐? 쫓아가야지!","source_cn":"喊有什么用，出去追啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D7E1FB7EB5E7DDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910239025:1":{"text":"젠장, 워터라이더를 아직 못 고쳤는데... 뛰어가는 수밖에 없겠어. 어서 따라와!","source_cn":"该死，水行器还废着……只能用跑的了，跟上咱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x539BE50F77DBAE46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1910239025":{"text":"젠장, 워터라이더를 아직 못 고쳤는데... 뛰어가는 수밖에 없겠어. 어서 따라와!","source_cn":"该死，水行器还废着……只能用跑的了，跟上咱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x539BE50F77DBAE46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1910239026:1":{"text":"이 할미도 함께 가마.","source_cn":"好孩子们，阿嬷也和你们一起去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96896809F7682660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1910239027:0":{"text":"탄생의 연못은 <style=\"highlight\">타라사 중심부</style>에 있으니, 말랑이는 그쪽으로 갔을 게야.","source_cn":"繁育池就在<style